    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061121.0058\n\nSAITAMA, Japan, Nov. 21 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nResults of men's volleyball World Championship\n\n\n\n\nFollowing are the results from the first round matches of 2006 men's volleyball World Championships which held here on Tuesday:\n\nGroup A in Saitama:\n\nEgypt lost to China, 2-3 (25-22, 25-22, 30-32, 20-25, 16-18);\n\nPuerto Rico vs Poland;\n\nJapan vs Argentina;\n\nGroup B in Fukuoka:\n\nCuba bt Greece, 3-2 (25-19, 20-25, 25-22, 21-25, 15-12);\n\nAustralia vs Brazil;\n\nGermany vs France;\n\nGroup C in Nagano:\n\nIran lost to Bulgaria, 0-3 (19-25, 18-25, 23-25);\n\nCzech Republic vs Venezuela;\n\nItaly vs United States;\n\nGroup D in Sendai:\n\nTunisia lost to Canada, 2-3 (15-25, 29-27, 25-21, 21-25, 13-15);\n\nSerbia Montenegro vs South Korea;\n\nRussia vs Kazakhstan.",
